    description: "Gesetz für die Wärmeplanung und zur Dekarbonisierung der Wärmenetze,
      in force since 1 January 2024. § 29(1): at least 30 % of a heat network's annual
      net heat generation from renewable energy or unavoidable waste heat from 1 January
      2030, and 80 % from 1 January 2040. § 29(2): deadline extensions to the end
      of 2034 and of 2044 on application. § 31(1, https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/wpg/__31.html):
      entirely renewable or waste heat by the end of 31 December 2044. Text as published
      on 17 November 2026; the 2026 amendment was not in force.; Attachment: source_material/WPG-para-29-gesetze-im-internet-2026-11-17.html;
